                    </svg></div>
                  <div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-white">About Us</div>
                </div>
                <div class="breadcrumb-title-block">
                  <h1 class="heading-style-1 title-animation">Transforming Business With Intelligent AI</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="breadcrumb-summary-block">
                  <p class="text-size-large text-color-heading-color-0-8">Founded in 2020, Gridora is on a mission to make enterprise-grade artificial intelligence accessible to every business. We believe that data-driven insights shouldn&#x27;t be limited to tech giants—they should empower organizations of all sizes to make smarter decisions, faster.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="section_our-story">
          <div class="section-gap">
            <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-main w-container">
              <div class="our-story-wrapper">
                <div class="section-heading-block align-center">
                  <div class="section-subtitle-block align-center"><img src="/images/subtitle-icon.svg" loading="lazy" alt="subtitle-icon" class="subtitle-icon">
                    <div class="text-size-small text-weight-medium text-color-white">Our Story</div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="section-title-block top-space max-width-28-5rem">
                    <h2 class="heading-style-2 text-align-middle title-animation">What We Do</h2>
                  </div>
                  <div class="section-summary-block top-space max-width-29rem">
                    <p class="text-size-large text-align-middle">Every great company starts with a problem that needs solving. Here&#x27;s how Gridora came to be.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="our-story-content-block">
                  <div class="our-story-card-block">
                    <div class="our-story-card-image-block"><img src="/images/our-story-image-1_1our-story-image-1.avif" loading="lazy" data-w-id="c267be2f-81ce-9010-877c-79313311380a" alt="our-story-card-image" class="our-story-card-image">
                      <div data-w-id="d1b0b305-85f6-582b-69f5-227109cbf940" class="card-image-overlay"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-card-content-block">
                      <div class="our-story-card-text-block">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-5">The Spark</h3>
                        <p class="text-size-regular">Late one night in a Cambridge coffee shop, Dr. Sarah Chen and Michael Rodriguez realized that while AI research was advancing rapidly, businesses were struggling to implement even basic analytics. The gap between academic AI and practical business tools was enormous.</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="our-story-card-date-block">
                        <div class="our-story-date-title">Date &amp; Time</div>
                        <p class="text-size-regular">12 June 2026</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="our-story-card-block is-2">
                    <div class="our-story-card-content-block">
                      <div class="our-story-card-text-block">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-5">The First Prototype</h3>
                        <p class="text-size-regular">Working nights and weekends from a small apartment, the founding team built the first version of Gridora. The goal was simple: make enterprise-grade AI analytics as easy as using a spreadsheet. After 6 months of intense development, they had something revolutionary.</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="our-story-card-date-block">
                        <div class="our-story-date-title">Date &amp; Time</div>
                        <p class="text-size-regular">12 June 2018</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-card-image-block"><img src="/images/our-story-image-2_1our-story-image-2.avif" loading="lazy" alt="our-story-card-image" class="our-story-card-image">
                      <div class="card-image-overlay"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="our-story-card-block is-3">
                    <div class="our-story-card-content-block is-3">
                      <div class="our-story-card-text-block">
                        <h3 class="heading-style-5">The Breakthrough</h3>
                        <p class="text-size-regular">Their first customer, a mid-sized fintech company, used Gridora to detect fraud patterns that had cost them millions. Within 3 months, fraud incidents dropped 67%. Word spread quickly, and suddenly, they had a waitlist of companies wanting access.</p>
                      </div>
                      <div class="our-story-card-date-block">
                        <div class="our-story-date-title">Date &amp; Time</div>
                        <p class="text-size-regular">12 June 2017</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="our-story-card-image-block is-3"><img src="/images/our-story-image-3_1our-story-image-3.avif" loading="lazy" alt="our-story-card-image" class="our-story-card-image">
                      <div class="card-image-overlay"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
